  "三0口",
  "‹< Back",
  "About Us",
  "About iSupport-D",
  "iSupport-Digital (iSupport-D) is an online",
  "program designed to support family carers of",
  "people living with dementia and aged care",
  "workers, especially those from culturally and",
  "linguistically diverse communities.",
  "Based on the World Health Organization's",
  "iSupport program, iSupport-D has been",
  "culturally adapted for carers in Australia.",
  "Through the platform, users can access:",
  "• Multilingual learning modules and short",
  "videos to build caregiving skills",
  "• Culturally tailored tips and information",
  "relevant to your situation",
  "• A dementia service finder to help you locate",
  "local support",
  "• Online support groups in different",
  "languages",
  "• Helpful reminders and encouragement to",
  "stay on track",
  "• An interactive chatbot to help you quickly",
  "find what you need. For example, you can",
  "ask: \"My dad is becoming aggressive - what",
  "should I do?\". The chatbot will guide you to",
  "the most relevant lesson, video, or resource",
  "in the app.",
  "• These features are designed to help you feel",
  "more confident, informed, and supported in",
  "your caregiving journey.",
  "The program focuses on carers from Arabic-,",
  "Cantonese-, Italian-, Mandarin-, and",
  "Vietnamese-speaking communities and is",
  "developed by a research team specialising in",
  "digital health and dementia care, in partnership",
  "with carers and community organisations.",
  "For more information:",
  "ediva@nari.edu.au"
 ]
